					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茶博士刘苏"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990803,
					"content": "二爷念旧我是能明白，就是没想到，这都几十年了，他还惦记着以前的事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茶博士刘苏"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990804,
					"content": "这下就都明白了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "云堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990805,
					"content": "我没明白。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990806
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710990806,
					"content": "这是以前的旧事，既然你也被卷进来了，那告诉你也无妨。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "云堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990807,
					"content": "范二爷年轻的时候也能唱，和若心前辈常年搭戏，他们两个总在台上扮一对，大概二爷心里当了真吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "云堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990808,
					"content": "不过，若心前辈其实另有心上人，后来她逐渐厌倦了舞台生活，就和她那位一道去了轻策庄。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "云堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990809,
					"content": "不知道中间出了什么变故，那位没能和若心前辈在轻策庄团聚，她就孤身留在了那里，直到现在。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "云堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990810,
					"content": "二爷知道我常去轻策庄看望若心前辈，总跟我打听她的近况。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "云堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990811,
					"content": "可见他还是念着若心前辈，不愿意造新戏台也是想给过去留个念想。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "云堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990812,
					"content": "唉，既然这个戏台对二爷这么重要，那新戏台肯定是修不了了，木匠也白请了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茶博士刘苏"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990813,
					"content": "这也未必，我有办法，刘苏先生等着看吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "云堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990814,
					"content": "你当真有好办法？只要能修成，我事后一定好好谢谢云老板。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990815
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茶博士刘苏"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990815,
					"content": "#多了我也不需要，刘苏先生单给我讲一场《裁雨声》吧，这回我想听完，{NICKNAME}也可以一起。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "云堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990816,
					"content": "感觉云堇和平时不太一样。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990817
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710990817,
					"content": "我们茶馆和云翰社的交情多厚哪，云老板跟我们当然比跟别人亲近。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茶博士刘苏"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990818,
					"content": "您放心，以后一定单独给你们开一场。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990819
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茶博士刘苏"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990819,
					"content": "好了，我们「茶」也喝完了，该去跟二爷说道说道了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "云堇"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7109909,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7109909
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7109909",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7109909,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"范二爷"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 710990901,
					"content": "二爷，我们刚刚正喝着茶，我突然想起来若心前辈跟我说什么了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990902
					],
					"speakerTitle": "云堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990902,
					"content": "哦，她说什么呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990903
					],
					"speakerTitle": "范二爷"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990903,
					"content": "她说：「二哥总爱跟自己过不去，听着让人难过。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "云堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990904,
					"content": "唉，还是她明白我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990905
					],
					"speakerTitle": "范二爷"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990905,
					"content": "不过，她好像也不怎么怀念这个旧物件啊，只有我还在自己跟自己较劲。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990906
					],
					"speakerTitle": "范二爷"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990906,
					"content": "我坚持不让别人动这个戏台不是自讨没趣吗？算了算了，你们修吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990907
					],
					"speakerTitle": "范二爷"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990907,
					"content": "二爷这是有情有义，怎么能说是自讨没趣呢？您这么说我可不爱听。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990908
					],
					"speakerTitle": "云堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990908,
					"content": "戏台还是要修的，但也不能破坏了二爷的念想。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990909
					],
					"speakerTitle": "云堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990909,
					"content": "你们终于肯动工了啊？好，我这就安排。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990910
					],
					"speakerTitle": "大雨"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990910,
					"content": "我准备的图纸你们可以看看，群玉阁上那座大戏台就是照着这份图纸打造的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990911
					],
					"speakerTitle": "大雨"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990911,
					"content": "按照这个设计，这两边的墙都要打掉哈，还有…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990912
					],
					"speakerTitle": "大雨"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990912,
					"content": "不着急，这个戏台我想还是得修旧如旧，既然是木地板响动影响演出，那就先修修地板。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990913
					],
					"speakerTitle": "云堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990913,
					"content": "其余的往后再说，刘苏先生，这样可以吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990914
					],
					"speakerTitle": "云堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990914,
					"content": "只要这戏台修完了不再影响平时演出，具体怎么修都听云老板和二爷安排。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990915
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茶博士刘苏"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990915,
					"content": "啊，就这样？不造新戏台了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990916
					],
					"speakerTitle": "大雨"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990916,
					"content": "我看这样好，还是云老板的主意妙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990917
					],
					"speakerTitle": "范二爷"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990917,
					"content": "正巧修戏台用的木板也不用额外采购，码头上就有现成的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990918
					],
					"speakerTitle": "范二爷"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990918,
					"content": "#这位…{NICKNAME}还得麻烦你走一遭，这次跑腿的酬金稍后一起给你结算好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990919
					],
					"speakerTitle": "范二爷"
				},
				{
					"id": 710990919,
					"content": "可以。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710990920
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710990920,
					"content": "…好吧，一起交给我好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "大雨"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7109911,
