				{
					"id": 710995502,
					"content": "关于若心…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710995503
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710995503,
					"content": "其实我的确是刚从轻策庄回来，也的确是去探望若心前辈了，前辈说的话也是真的，只是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710995504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "云堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710995504,
					"content": "只是？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710995505
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710995505,
					"content": "嘘！只是我啊，没说全。前辈那一整句话是：",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710995506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "云堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710995506,
					"content": "「二哥总爱跟自己过不去，抠抠搜搜的，周围人也跟着他受罪，听着让人难过。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710995507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "云堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710995507,
					"content": "虽然是大实话，但要是全说了，二爷该不开心了，我才只说了半截。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "云堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710995508,
					"content": "我先坐会儿。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710995509
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710995509,
					"content": "好啊，我第二喜欢的就是等个好天气，来茶馆里坐着。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710995510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "云堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710995510,
					"content": "刘苏先生不开讲的时候，就坐在这里听听市声，也很舒心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710995511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "云堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710995511,
					"content": "第一喜欢的呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710995512
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710995512,
					"content": "当然是登台唱戏呀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710995513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "云堇"
				},
				{
					"id": 710995513,
					"content": "我确实还有很多话想跟你聊聊，但你看，刘苏先生还在一边等着你拿来木板修戏台呢。",
